  "prefLabel": "Sw 901.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 901.02 Scope. This rule applies to any lottery claimant of a prize that meets or exceeds the reportable winning amounts set by the Internal Revenue Code, and who is past due on court ordered child support payments.\n\nSource. #12090, eff 1-27-17",
